'' A USING OF AN IMPORT BELONGS TO THE FILE THAT WRITES IT (M22). a.tiko writes '#import
'' "../util"' and 'using util'; b.tiko writes '#import "../other"' and 'using other', and both
'' modules have a public Foo. Each file's bare Foo is its own using's: 42 and 7. The files are
'' read as one unit, so b.tiko saw a.tiko's using as well and its Foo was TKO0919.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/modules/src/usingfile/ok.tiko -o tests/modules/usingfile-ok.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/usingfile-ok.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  42             7
